<title>SWITZERLAND: Clariant says oper profit rise continued.</title>
<headline>Clariant says oper profit rise continued.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss chemicals group Clariant AG said operating profit continued to grow in the first two months of 1997 after rising 11 percent in 1996 from the year before to 235 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>&quot;The improvement in operating profit achieved in 1996 has proven itself to be sustainable,&quot; Clariant said in a statement released before its annual news conference.</p>
<p>&quot;The operating profit improvement also continued in the first two months of 1997,&quot; it added without elaborating.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
